 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 508095,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "One week, Zac ran a total of 122 miles. How much time did he spend running in that week? ",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Zac runs at a constant speed of 4 miles per hour.</p>\n<p>Set up the two ratios as proportions to answer this question.</p>\n<p>Let <i>x</i> = the time spent running.</p>\n<p>It helps many students to create a table to help set up their ratios.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>Exchange</td>\n<td>What I have or want</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>miles</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>122</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>hours</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td><i>x</i></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Set up your proportion.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered unstyled\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\frac{4}{1} = \\frac{{122}}{x}\"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"4x = \\left( 1 \\right)\\left( {122} \\right)\"></span></td>\n<td>Cross multiply</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\frac{{4x}}{4} = \\frac{{122}}{4}\"></span></td>\n<td>Divide.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"x = 30.5\"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Zac ran 30.5 hours.</p>\n<p>Alternate answer: Zac ran for 30 hours and 30 minutes.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "30.5 hours (or 30½ hours, or 30 hours and 30 minutes)"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
